// microbench hop1p7_knows: the 7 PERSON_PROPS of every distinct knows-neighbor of a person,
// sorted by firstName.
// Reads: the knows edge index (both sides), then each distinct friend's document.
// Evaluator: queries/hop.py _hop1p(7) -- read_neighbors + dedup + read_vertex_props(7 props),
// one row per friend.
// mb2 lineage: MB21-26 (width x fan-out cross, MICROBENCH2 #2).
FOR v IN 1..1 ANY CONCAT("Person/", @personId) knows
    OPTIONS {order: "bfs", uniqueVertices: "global"}
    SORT v.firstName
    RETURN {firstName: v.firstName, lastName: v.lastName, gender: v.gender,
            birthday: v.birthday, creationDate: v.creationDate, locationIP: v.locationIP,
            browserUsed: v.browserUsed}
